    "detailed_description": "Mossroot is a party-based tactical RPG Roguelike. Climb up a fortified mountain. Fight bandits, knights, cavemen and more. Power up your team, make hard decisions, recruit enemies to help fight against tyranny. Bring them to your Homebase, get to know them and build a safe haven together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/a0173b81e29dc1293ffa02639b441285.poster.avif?t=1722606415\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/a0173b81e29dc1293ffa02639b441285.webm?t=1722606415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong><u>Fight Your Way to the Top</u></strong><br><br>Take down the Evil King! Climb his treacherous mountain, travel through varied dangerous biomes, each with their own cadre of monsters, bandits, and potential allies. Find treasures in each fight: runes that will power up your teammates, and items like bombs and potions you can use to fight your foes. No run is exactly the same, the map up the mountain is procedurally generated.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/dcd969eed112a0037554e036a4730b37.poster.avif?t=1722606415\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/dcd969eed112a0037554e036a4730b37.webm?t=1722606415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><u><strong>Make Difficult Decisions</strong></u><br><br>You'll make pitstops on your way up the hill. Some are simply places to catch your breath, but watch out, others will force you to make important decisions. Are you willing to sacrifice on strength to increase another? The choices you make will decide how easy your attempt is.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/7bac0e8e2d31b675c9ebafbe97145b82.poster.avif?t=1722606415\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/7bac0e8e2d31b675c9ebafbe97145b82.webm?t=1722606415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong><u>Recruit Your Enemies</u></strong><br><br>Not everyone you face is a bad guy. Recruit sympathetic souls to your cause by finding what they want and fulfilling it. Each new unit has their own special powers they can use, some synergising with each other, creating different teams to build and new ways to play the game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/e29b47ca949cef4f043a9b9147603d12.poster.avif?t=1722606415\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/e29b47ca949cef4f043a9b9147603d12.webm?t=1722606415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong><u>Build a Safe Haven Together</u></strong><br><br>Bring your new recruits back to your homebase, a village destroyed by war. Talk to them, learn their life, and rebuild the town together. As you grow in size, you'll find merchants and other services that will help your runs become easier, or even harder, with greater reward.<br><strong><u><br>Features:</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 15 playable characters<br></li><li>4 different biomes, each with a wide variety of enemies<br></li><li>a homebase that grows with you<br></li><li>Options to make your runs easier or harder</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Mossroot is a party-based tactical RPG Roguelike. Climb up a fortified mountain. Fight bandits, knights, cavemen and more. Power up your team, make hard decisions, recruit enemies to help fight against tyranny. Bring them to your Homebase, get to know them and build a safe haven together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/a0173b81e29dc1293ffa02639b441285.poster.avif?t=1722606415\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/a0173b81e29dc1293ffa02639b441285.webm?t=1722606415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong><u>Fight Your Way to the Top</u></strong><br><br>Take down the Evil King! Climb his treacherous mountain, travel through varied dangerous biomes, each with their own cadre of monsters, bandits, and potential allies. Find treasures in each fight: runes that will power up your teammates, and items like bombs and potions you can use to fight your foes. No run is exactly the same, the map up the mountain is procedurally generated.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/dcd969eed112a0037554e036a4730b37.poster.avif?t=1722606415\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/dcd969eed112a0037554e036a4730b37.webm?t=1722606415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><u><strong>Make Difficult Decisions</strong></u><br><br>You'll make pitstops on your way up the hill. Some are simply places to catch your breath, but watch out, others will force you to make important decisions. Are you willing to sacrifice on strength to increase another? The choices you make will decide how easy your attempt is.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/7bac0e8e2d31b675c9ebafbe97145b82.poster.avif?t=1722606415\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/7bac0e8e2d31b675c9ebafbe97145b82.webm?t=1722606415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong><u>Recruit Your Enemies</u></strong><br><br>Not everyone you face is a bad guy. Recruit sympathetic souls to your cause by finding what they want and fulfilling it. Each new unit has their own special powers they can use, some synergising with each other, creating different teams to build and new ways to play the game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/e29b47ca949cef4f043a9b9147603d12.poster.avif?t=1722606415\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419500/extras/e29b47ca949cef4f043a9b9147603d12.webm?t=1722606415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong><u>Build a Safe Haven Together</u></strong><br><br>Bring your new recruits back to your homebase, a village destroyed by war. Talk to them, learn their life, and rebuild the town together. As you grow in size, you'll find merchants and other services that will help your runs become easier, or even harder, with greater reward.<br><strong><u><br>Features:</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 15 playable characters<br></li><li>4 different biomes, each with a wide variety of enemies<br></li><li>a homebase that grows with you<br></li><li>Options to make your runs easier or harder</li></ul>",
